    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d584">

                <pb facs="1352" n="1238" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg1238"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    J.C.S. Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Secretaries of the Combined Chiefs of
                        Staff</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d584-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        C.C.S. 331</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-09-01">1 September 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Netherlands Marine Landing Force</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The enclosure received from the Netherlands Staff Mission is referred to the
                    Combined Chiefs of Staff for consideration.</p>
                <p>It is suggested that the Secretaries be directed to draft a reply along the
                    following lines: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Combined Chiefs of Staff have noted with interest that the
                            Netherlands Military and Naval authorities are working on plans for
                            raising an Army to participate in the war against Japan following the
                            liberation of Holland. They will be pleased to review these plans upon
                            their completion and give them such support as is justified in the
                            prosecution of the war.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Redman</hi>
                        <lb/> J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Deane</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Combined Secretariat</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d584-a1.xml" xpointer="d584-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d584-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d584-f1-content">
                <p>For the action taken on this paper at the 117th and 118th Meetings of the
                    Combined Chiefs of Staff, September 3 and 10, 1943, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1205">pp. 1205</ref>, <ref target="#pg1221"
                        >1221</ref>.</p>
            </note>
